32
00:01:41,172 --> 00:01:45,584
Other churches call it Fourth Baruch
and keep it outside the Bible.

33
00:01:45,584 --> 00:01:49,535
Ethiopian Bibles print it with
the Lamentations of Jeremiah.

34
00:01:49,985 --> 00:01:52,865
Now, back to that tree.
Follow for the waking.

35
00:01:54,815 --> 00:01:58,313
Abimelech wakes with a heavy
head. A short nap, he thinks.

36
00:01:58,763 --> 00:02:01,782
He uncovers the basket.
The figs are dripping with

37
00:02:01,782 --> 00:02:04,075
milk, as fresh as when he picked them.

38
00:02:04,525 --> 00:02:08,226
But in Jerusalem he knows no
street, no house, no face. He

39
00:02:08,226 --> 00:02:11,608
