outside the city, grieving.

40
00:02:12,058 --> 00:02:14,559
An old man comes in from the fields.

41
00:02:14,559 --> 00:02:16,922
Where is Jeremiah? Abimelech asks.

42
00:02:17,372 --> 00:02:21,038
Sixty‑six years, the old man
tells him. Jeremiah is in

43
00:02:21,038 --> 00:02:24,433
Babylon, with all the
people, for sixty‑six years.

44
00:02:24,883 --> 00:02:28,105
Abimelech nearly laughs.
He only went out for figs.

45
00:02:28,555 --> 00:02:31,407
Then look, says the old
man. It is the month

46
00:02:31,407 --> 00:02:33,547
