68
00:03:46,183 --> 00:03:50,066
Jeremiah reads the letter to the
people. The exile is ending.

69
00:03:52,016 --> 00:03:54,485
Did you know? The rabbis told of Honi, who

70
00:03:54,485 --> 00:03:56,837
