71
00:03:57,287 --> 00:04:01,234
Christians told of seven young
men asleep in a cave at Ephesus.

72
00:04:01,684 --> 00:04:05,743
A modern commentary places
Abimelech's tale behind the Seven

73
00:04:05,743 --> 00:04:09,193
Sleepers, and in the family
tree of Rip Van Winkle.

74
00:04:09,643 --> 00:04:14,187
Only one Bible still carries
Abimelech's. Follow for the final part.

75
00:04:16,137 --> 00:04:19,600
So what does the sleeper
teach? God kept His promise to

76
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:22,623
