a way no one expected.

77
00:04:23,073 --> 00:04:28,076
And notice how we know it: a
verse in Jeremiah, a Ge'ez text

78
00:04:28,076 --> 00:04:33,163
printed in 1866, and scholars
who still argue over sixty‑six.

79
00:04:33,613 --> 00:04:36,017
When a post says a book
was banned from the

80
